{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":483558,\"title\":\"Sharing Christmas\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A real estate developer is given the opportunity of his career to transform an old shopping complex into a prime location. Unfortunately, there is one tenant who is holding out—the Christmas shop owner he met by happenstance just days ago.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rbcQlnr10rmpyqGftTeZvtbKCeq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sQMNl9chkRmQLO9AMfWiQYhW5PA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":57,\"year\":2017,\"runtime\":84,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Peter Sullivan\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":92591,\"name\":\"Peter Sullivan\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hXFy4ygelHJovKvMx37EJeHwvbm.jpg\"},{\"id\":83218,\"name\":\"Ellen Hollman\",\"character\":\"Stephanie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ebNqpUF7WFr4lhP6FhT9O1doc8q.jpg\"},{\"id\":94421,\"name\":\"Bobby Campo\",\"character\":\"Michael\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ART3lx7kJEC3vNJBKqILCKKOuM.jpg\"},{\"id\":184120,\"name\":\"Dave Koz\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pGDnuCR09EqyDG82zdijbqwLueG.jpg\"},{\"id\":47882,\"name\":\"Cynthia Gibb\",\"character\":\"Helen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ctIkvIE2F0bnDBHvmIVP1NK6nJq.jpg\"},{\"id\":200870,\"name\":\"Melanie Nelson\",\"character\":\"Patty\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bbO2KCwJzRrE5rgkzghKW870Pt3.jpg\"},{\"id\":39465,\"name\":\"David Starzyk\",\"character\":\"Dan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2XaahGfUSds3j4WqeVpvsyTOBRW.jpg\"},{\"id\":143427,\"name\":\"Jon Prescott\",\"character\":\"David\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rL7WQgJjQADITLxKazcEyWD2msD.jpg\"},{\"id\":97857,\"name\":\"Pamela Roylance\",\"character\":\"Iris\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lpJYXvuAK0yJsByRYJ87uUEGp1z.jpg\"},{\"id\":1242234,\"name\":\"Jade Harlow\",\"character\":\"Julia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l2tUUs9fdwWiWSCdUBWdHHrHExK.jpg\"},{\"id\":2069883,\"name\":\"Colby Strong\",\"character\":\"Toby\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aiOM2hZxefFYYV5e2FjSFmIyC4g.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":554279,\"title\":\"Return to Christmas Creek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gCdjZCWM9x9vAbtkvZiIIYL7tOB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zNUmOf9vOk0f146jQBrBkdmrZyH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As Christmas approaches, Amelia Hughes, a career-focused Chicago app developer lacking in holiday spirit, returns to her small hometown of Christmas Creek to rediscover the meaning of Christmas. There, she reunites with her childhood best friend Mike and her estranged uncle Harry, whose mysterious rift with Amelia’s father divided her family during the holiday season when she was a child.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":643882,\"title\":\"The Princess Switch: Switched Again\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4vOmeimnVCdojwvc4icyeYUCydJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zCHe8ckyufHVUZaoHu2DiF8evET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Duchess Margaret unexpectedly inherits the throne & hits a rough patch with Kevin, it’s up to Stacy to save the day before a new lookalike — party girl Fiona — foils their plans.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550023,\"title\":\"Christmas at the Palace\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lD6xv3dz6AStcYsrDk6sqHKMgxD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7v8axUqFZIsbvzDWY4acQ5uXCf8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Katie, a former professional ice skater, is hired by the king of San Senova, Alexander, to help his daughter in a Christmas ice skating performance. As Katie spends time in the castle and with the king, she and Alex begin to develop feelings for each other and ultimately fall in love. But will the tradition-loving people of San Senova allow their king to make a foreigner their queen?\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79113,\"title\":\"A Princess for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocyOdgL8pGS5KRpRfS69SsS2GMa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her sister and brother-in-law's tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law's father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":587693,\"title\":\"A Christmas Prince: The Royal Baby\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4RErLw0APt8qQiee0d8VCKasWwl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuCj46exjP6UOo976MAWACWFv1X.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Christmas brings the ultimate gift to Aldovia: a royal baby. But first, Queen Amber must help her family and kingdom by finding a missing peace treaty.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81393,\"title\":\"12 Dates of Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26X4Lldt6bwLnrX6kkLfUZTLojw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FwEg4xVszVPEq1Hj1GNqV208mm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an attempt to win back her ex-boyfriend Jack on Christmas Eve, Kate ends up ruining her blind date with Miles, a handsome guy she's been set up with. In a strange twist of fate, Kate is magically given the chance to re-live Christmas Eve twelve times!\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100642,\"title\":\"'Twas the Text Before Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e1fvQdD63RP2MS9jCB8jzg7fkdr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/498VjeTVd051iuEducr5MkZYKKf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Addie is a New York City chiropractor mistakenly receives a text from “Nana.” The accidental text turns into a loving friendship between the matronly Nana and Addie who now communicate regularly. Nana invites Addie to spend the holiday in Vermont. It is picture-postcard perfect and exactly as Nana described except for one surprise. Nana’s single son, James, a traveling doctor is also home for the holidays. Over three consecutive years, James and Addie are together during the holidays, though it isn’t until they are both single that they begin to see each other in a different light.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":961769,\"title\":\"Catering Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mmVZsiEYIN4AtRUCSJSIAZ8idjM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zcAp3HYUCUdjMhulJagyOuKF3pg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fledgling caterer, Molly Frost, is hired by Jean Harrison, the perfectionistic director of the renowned Harrison Foundation, to cater this year’s annual Christmas Gala dinner. Things get complicated when Molly falls for Jean’s nephew, Carson, 30s, a travel photographer with no desire to take over the family’s foundation… until his aunt assigns him to the task of making sure the catered dinner goes perfectly.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":360603,\"title\":\"Crown for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7lRL9n6Zvvl7BMpGzELvzWJx2df.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xlrfVXG27AND092TU8XKPWTyGn1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Allie Foster, a struggling New York artist, reluctantly accepts to act as a governess to a rebellious Princess Theodora of Winshire. When Allie forms an unlikely bond with the princess, she attracts the attention of the handsome King Maximillian, who’s facing an arranged marriage against his heart’s wishes. As Christmas Eve draws near, Allie finds herself swept up in romance, royalty and the spirit of the holidays.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":550385,\"title\":\"Christmas with a View\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jzDSyPq80DPRzTryh9qBOiJQI8o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h7u2zCHb4QW59Jbk5xuiUOuQyyJ.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This Christmas, Thunder Mountain Ski Resort is abuzz when celebrity chef Shane Roarke is named the new head chef. Clara Garrison isn't as excited and is instead focused on getting resettled after her failed attempt at opening a restaurant in the city. With their paths constantly crossing, will their shared passion for cooking bring them together or will secrets keep them apart?\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1028556,\"title\":\"Haul Out the Holly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/naX9S52wyTpUJPR80FIWhgxzufb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/29qiSnPp8LN1vUomrMN3MMVwlUH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Emily arrives home, hoping to visit her parents, only to discover that they are leaving on a trip of their own. As she stays at their house for the holidays, their HOA is determined to get Emily to participate in the neighborhood’s many Christmas festivities.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11661,\"title\":\"Joyeux Noel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Ka8lKCIiWjnZiMslPQeakS5UhW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ChBhGXIX7RgOMSjIlXgBp6UjMf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"France, 1914, during World War I. On Christmas Eve, an extraordinary event takes place in the bloody no man's land that the French and the Scots dispute with the Germans…\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"6hJc0OzhP0E\",\"name\":\"Sharing Christmas | Trailer (2017) | Ellen Hollman, Bobby Campo, Dave Koz, Cynthia Gibb\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}